Planning Benchmark open-split task data — Evaluation Data License

The task data in this directory (planning-benchmark-v2.jsonl,
planning-benchmark-v1.jsonl) is licensed free of charge for evaluation,
benchmarking, regression testing, and research, including redistribution of
unmodified copies, subject to:

1. ATTRIBUTION. Public results or redistributions must credit
   "WealthSchema Planning Benchmark (wealthschema.com/benchmark)".

2. NO TRAINING USE. The tasks and answer keys may NOT be used to train,
   fine-tune, or otherwise adjust the parameters of any model, nor be
   included in any training corpus or dataset compilation intended for
   training. Every record carries training_use_permitted: false; this flag
   may not be removed or altered in redistributed copies. Training on
   evaluation data destroys its evaluative value for every party whose
   results are compared against it.

3. INTEGRITY. Task text and answer keys may not be altered in copies
   presented as this benchmark. Derived works (translations, subsets) must
   be clearly labeled as modified and carry this license.

THE DATA IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. All scenarios
are synthetic; regulatory figures are cited to primary government documents
as of their stated tax-year vintage and are not tax, legal, or financial
advice.

The benchmark harness in the rest of this repository is licensed separately
under Apache-2.0 (see /LICENSE). The commercial task families (adversarial,
decision-recall) and the held-out reserve are proprietary and are NOT
covered by this license — see https://www.wealthschema.com/ai-eval-sets and
the long-form terms at https://www.wealthschema.com/license.
